    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say it's depression or whatever but it doesnt feel like a sickness. it just feels like an inevitability. like the lights are flickering and there's nothing i can actually do to fix the wiring. it feels more like... the end of a chapter than a problem to solve. like, why fight to keep the lights on when the house is already empty?",
